Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.11,0:01:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-Second Episode\NThe Rat Man
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Many happy returns of the day, friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.14,0:02:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Long live the harvest festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.86,0:02:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,These fireworks are magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.18,0:02:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They are celebrating the wheat harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! This year was excellent!\NBut where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.50,0:02:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- I’d like to go down into town.\N- Wait, I’m coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.18,0:02:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a minute, time to change my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.10,0:02:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But...! What a struggle! Are\Nyou coming in that outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.86,0:02:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?\NDon't tell me you don't like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.54,0:03:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Long live Silverland! Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a rich harvest!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.10,0:03:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's have a little drink to it!\N- Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.94,0:03:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the mice harvest is rich too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.42,0:03:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The mice! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- So many mice!\N- Damn! But how many are there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.10,0:04:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear little mice, this year\Nthe granaries of Silverland...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...are full of excellent wheat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.14,0:04:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Devour as much as you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.54,0:04:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.82,0:04:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick! Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.86,0:04:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are all these mice coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look there!\NThey’ve eaten all the wheat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.06,0:05:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't have anything left\Nto eat until the next harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How will we manage to get by?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just this year, when the harvest\Nhad been most abundant..!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.42,0:05:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't even have\Nseeds to plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.98,0:05:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If something doesn't happen,\Nwe'll all starve to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.30,0:05:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.06,0:05:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen so many rats in\Nmy life! Where could they have come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.70,0:05:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see the commotion in the\Nvillage over those rats, Grand Duke?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They said that all\Nthe grain has been plundered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.18,0:05:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,An excellent move! That man\Nwith the rats is very powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,just as an agent\Nof Union X should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, when Union X attacks\Nour kingdom to subjugate it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.02,0:05:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,they will succeed with great ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.06,0:05:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they'll be too hungry\Nto run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a messenger\Nfrom the Sovereign of Goldland!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.06,0:06:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a message\Nfor His Majesty the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A message\Nfrom the Sovereign of Goldland?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.22,0:06:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen!\NThe King of Goldland,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,informed of the calamity that\Nhas befallen our kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,has offered\Nto lend us some grain!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.46,0:06:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Sovereign, who does\Nnot want his subjects to suffer...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.42,0:06:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,neither hunger nor famine, has\Naccepted the King of Goldland’s offer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.90,0:06:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hurrah!\N- Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.50,0:06:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How kind of the King of Goldland!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.42,0:06:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Our granaries will be full again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.06,0:06:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.34,0:06:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavenly Father, forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.26,0:07:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too hungry\Nto be able to fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.90,0:07:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you won't be too angry\Nwith me if I take something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.82,0:07:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are Duralumin and Nylon\Ngoing in the middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.34,0:07:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.18,0:07:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.62,0:07:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you about to sit down to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.74,0:07:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! And I would be delighted\Nif you would have lunch with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.66,0:07:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you,\Nyou are very kind indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.18,0:07:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What a delicious smell! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.30,0:08:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a soup of worms,\Ncentipedes, and spiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.62,0:08:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This fry-up looks tasty.\NWhat is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.14,0:08:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a toad omelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.78,0:08:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Would you like some caterpillar soup?\N- No, thank you..!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong, or do you not like\Nmy cooking very much?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you would only like some liqueur?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.42,0:08:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, we'd prefer that!\N- We like liqueur very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.34,0:08:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! It's truly delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.14,0:08:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You like it, eh? It's distilled\Nbat blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.34,0:08:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, not like that!\NRemember that I'm eating lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive us, but we wanted to tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.38,0:08:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...that, after your little job\Nof making all the grain disappear,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Goldland has offered\Nto refill the empty granaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.70,0:08:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! I will make sure\Nthat not a single grain...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...can reach Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.22,0:08:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you manage to destroy\Nthat grain too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:08:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly! After all,\Nthe time has come again...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.86,0:09:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...to feed\Nmy dear little mice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.70,0:09:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, dear,\Nfor your long journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.54,0:09:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They inform me that the wheat wagons\Nwill leave Goldland tomorrow morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.50,0:09:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,led by Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.30,0:09:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And at what point do you intend\Nto have them attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.26,0:09:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Once past the border, the wagons\Nwill take the shortest route...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.26,0:09:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...to reach\NSilverland Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I will wait for them near the river...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...and every grain of wheat\Nwill end up as food for my mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the tanks took\Nthe other road, the one to the West?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't happen! It would be madness\Nto send the tanks down that road.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.78,0:09:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, not only is it very long,\Nbut it is also a mountain road:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,in many stretches it is so narrow\Nthat a tank would barely fit through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.26,0:09:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, friends!\NI know where to wait for those tanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.06,0:09:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You truly deserve to be\NMr. X's right-hand man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,F... F... Friend, stay calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.30,0:10:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I must give him something..\NHere, take this! You'll like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.94,0:10:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, my children!\NI have guests with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.70,0:10:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you stop fighting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.70,0:10:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.62,0:10:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Hurry up or something\Nterrible will happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.06,0:10:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.94,0:10:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.78,0:10:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! Every time she's about to\Nmeet Franz, she loses her head!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.34,0:11:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my dear little mice,\Ncome with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.90,0:11:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I will feed you the\Ntasty grain of Goldland!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready\Nfor another good feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.10,0:11:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, we are ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.90,0:11:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! I will bring\Nthis grain to Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.42,0:11:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens,\Nnothing will stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.86,0:11:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's go!\N- Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.62,0:12:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster! Keep the horses moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.06,0:12:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear it will be a tiring journey.\NWe have a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.22,0:13:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings to you, mysterious knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.38,0:13:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Frank, Princess\NSapphire sends you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.02,0:13:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.14,0:13:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What? She tells me to stop?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.22,0:13:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, this is an opportunity\Nto get rid of all those mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We will set a trap for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.22,0:13:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me carefully! I will\Nshow you what you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.10,0:13:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember to do\Nexactly what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.78,0:13:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not make a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.22,0:13:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I believe this\Nplan can work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.82,0:13:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your task will be very delicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.90,0:13:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is ready! Let's\Nget ready to spring the trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, my dear little\Nmice will give a hard time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...to that fool Prince\NFrank! It will be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.18,0:14:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up this pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.82,0:14:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear little mice, all the\Ngrain in those wagons is for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, my children! Loot!\NDestroy! Devour!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And let not even a grain\Nof that wheat remain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.74,0:15:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.42,0:15:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! They’re just mannequins!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.22,0:15:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gunpowder! And here\Nthere are barrels full of oil!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.02,0:15:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse it,\Nthey’ve set a trap for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.18,0:15:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot the arrows at the wagons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.02,0:15:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! My dear little mice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.62,0:15:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,An opening!\NThis way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.54,0:15:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come,\Nyou who are survivors!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.46,0:16:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor dears! Forgive me!\NI was a fool...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.74,0:16:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...to let you end up\Nin this trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.50,0:16:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time! Cut the ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.22,0:16:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Cursed Franz! I will remember\Nyou! One day I will have my revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.30,0:16:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here are the wagons!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.10,0:17:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They are preparing an\Nambush, exactly as I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.02,0:17:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.58,0:17:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s a landslide! Stop the wagons!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that mysterious\Nknight! I’ll show him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.50,0:17:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurray, I hit him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.18,0:17:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward, let’s attack\Nhim! Finish him! Finish him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.62,0:17:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.54,0:17:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready? Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.94,0:18:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright, mysterious knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.74,0:18:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, nothing serious.\NIt's only a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you from the bottom of my heart for saving me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.02,0:18:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it is I who must be grateful for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.30,0:18:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But what is the matter? Are you unwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.90,0:18:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's nothing. - I'll have your wound treated immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thank you, I'm fine!\NGoodbye, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.10,0:18:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,See you soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.02,0:18:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange knight...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.02,0:18:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's the grain wagons!\N- Long live Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.22,0:18:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He loves me not, he loves me, he loves me not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.54,0:19:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! This is Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for keeping you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.18,0:19:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that bandage? Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.02,0:19:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,yes...\NNo, well, it was a thorn
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.46,0:19:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I hurt myself on the stem of a rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.10,0:19:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A rose that has hurt your delightful little arm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...does not deserve to be a flower.\NI want to cut it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How kind you are..
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.86,0:19:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Princess Sapphire.\N- Franz..!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally we are face to face, Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.50,0:19:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I will have no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.46,0:19:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, throw me the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.50,0:20:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.90,0:20:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're trapped!\N- Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.78,0:20:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Surrender, if you value your life!\N- Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.62,0:20:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now talk! Tell us who you really are!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.34,0:20:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you attack me?\NWhat were you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to avenge the mice you killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.82,0:20:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Those dear little animals of mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.90,0:20:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The mice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.62,0:20:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sorry, but this time\Nyou'll have to let our friend go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.02,0:20:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is a friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.18,0:21:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying the two of you\Nhave allied yourselves with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.70,0:21:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly!\NI had requested his help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.82,0:21:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,.. ...to have the mice invade the\Ntown and thus take possession of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodbye! - What?!\N- Hey, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.18,0:21:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the plan has failed, I have\Nnothing more to do with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.46,0:21:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm going to Mr. X\Nto inform him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.22,0:21:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.38,0:21:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodbye!\N- Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.58,0:21:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember that I have something\Nvery urgent to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.38,0:21:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.10,0:21:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.10,0:21:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You were very good, Franz, at\Ngiving those two a good lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.54,0:21:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I believe they\Nwon't forget it for a long while
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.74,0:21:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We were lucky.\NUnion X will be discouraged now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.74,0:21:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a great feat\Nto defeat the rat man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.66,0:22:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?\NIf you are always close,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.86,0:22:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,you will be so strong\Nas to overcome all adversity!
