Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.42,0:23:46.42,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.42,0:23:49.86,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}tsu{\k17}na{\k27}i{\k21}da {\k17}ko{\k21}ko{\k29}ro {\k16}wa {\k22}ha{\k32}na{\k26}re{\k14}na{\k79}i
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.42,0:23:49.86,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Our bonded hearts will never part.
